      "label": "Rich man feigns death to avoid repaying a trivial debt",
      "taxonomy_refs": ["sacred_exchange", "trickster_boundary"],
      "basis": "Marko the Rich borrows a single copeck from a poor moujik, repeatedly refuses to repay it by claiming he has no small change, and then stages his own death so his wife can tell the creditor he has just died, treating a small economic obligation as something to be escaped even by crossing into the realm of the dead.",
