      "evidence_refs": ["ev:9"]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:13",
      "text": "Gudrun turns away from talking and goes to see what the wolves have left of Sigurd; she sits over her slain husband without sighing, striking her hands, or wailing as other women do.",
