      "type": "summary",
      "locator": "lines 2995-3101",
      "quote_or_summary": "Because of her dislike of dirt and dust, the maiden lives apart from her family in a room above the other apartments. There she sits on the floor and plays with the child, laughing at its pranks and smiling at it, while it responds with baby cooings and smiles. Her heart becomes happy and loving, and she is so absorbed that she forgets the passage of time.",
